        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sugoocheanda siguura Asa ghwajoar fuga Gushi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghami Abiya ak geebung'sa murdeeda ghweanigaaschi, ak geebuy aba jeeda mujiineeda Dawdi; ama ng'ata goombaliischi orjeedaanyi was Asa aba hoorgeadaanyi. Damanda eawoojigaaschi ng'eanyiida abeeda gwanda jeeda fuufta gweanyeew damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin Asa miyinda ea doobiiwnata aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANYI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanda heeda wagiida bea rabasta ea heetiyeada, ak gwahirjeawi daranajeega ak geelakiisa ng'eanyi Asherimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwanung' gagaseada fuga Yuda NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA ghweaniga nyaawa, ak ghoang'waayi deaweeda ea diigheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageandeawa jeesinga mujiinajeega sean bea Yuda heetiyeada ea heeda wagiida bea haleanjeeda ng'andidi. Ng'ata ghwanyas fuufta gheambalmeadaanyi aba damandaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwadeas mujiinajeega sineaweesa hilooga, aba gideaba ng'eanyiida niba seayu. Aba gideaba gweanyeekiga manda ng'ucheeda, aba gideaba niidaw NG'UTAMIIDA hoyyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Yuda, “Beeni eadeasa mujiinajeesu, ak geeneaweesi ghamarda ea madalajeega, ea gidaghuudajeega ea gharinga; ng'eanyiida gudea deanya, aba gideaba sigaseadi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA; sigaseadi niny ak ghamneawa ea ninyakneasa hoyyoo aba meadajeega sean.” Hean gwadeekshi ak gabaruur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak hean Asa gaba shirikaraji sagalamnyooji bughalaji samwagu leabu Yuda, mideawa igeambooniga, ea ng'utkeaka, ea fih sagalamnyooji bughalaji iyeenya ea seedam bea Benjamini, fuga eada igeambooniga ea gea jakiida ghuweanga, fiisu seaniin gwandeawa uurjeenga nea ea daruusi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Sera bea ng'eanyiida Gushi ghwaan gang'uchi sea shirikaraji sagalamnyooji sagalama ea mutukwaji bughalaji samwagu ak ghapka ea gwariiksa Maresha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwarita Asa gawa gwaroonyi niny, ak gaba nih sin ghealooniga ng'ucheeda aba jeeda moangoachiyda Sefata mida Maresha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gooyeawusa Asa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANYI, “Ea NG'UTAMIIDA manda siida weeta uurjeeweey, aba jeeda fuga mideawa uurjeenga ea gea mandeawana. Weadeasa, Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA, aba gideaba aseasa geeduukseey ang'iing'i ak ghwahit, nea aba gheawungaagu ea sipkaanyi eeng'ucheena fiisu saang'aan. Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, ang'iing'i guwoosi ASEETEANYA; adiidu gumwasi ghwajoarnyi siida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwajoar NG'UTAMIIDA fuga Gushi aba madeeda Asa ea Yuda, aba ng'ata gamng'aw fuga Gushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwaat Asa sea fuga mideawa geeshta nyaawa ea ghwahita Gerari, hean gameewa fuga Gushi ea eamudu eapuut eara agi; aba gideaba gooshealsa madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea shirikareadaanyi. Hean ghoang'waay ak ghwaat fuga Yuda giing'oonyanga saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gahuuyda mujiinajeega sean neaweesa Gerari, aba gideaba gharbeeda NG'UTAMIIDA gwanda badahuuka nyaawa. Ak ghaghas mujiinajeega sean, aba gideaba gwanda jeeda nyaawa easanga saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gahuuyda eara maheemajeega fuga mideawa dugwa, aba ng'ata ghwaat gisilga ea ngamiyajeega saang'a. Ak gabiikta Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
